spec PushUnrecorded.tla
check INVARIANTS OnlySavedSchedule OnlyDuePending NoMarkForArchivedDelivery TerminalSuppresses FlagsEveryMissingKind
reach Future | snapshots
reach BeforeGrace | snapshots
reach GraceBoundary | snapshots
reach Partial | snapshots
reach Combined | snapshots
reach Canceled | snapshots
reach Replaced | snapshots
reach Unrelated | snapshots
reach DiagnosticOnly | snapshots
run snapshots |
